## 📚 Key Takeaway

This project reinforced the importance of looking at data from multiple perspectives. Global totals provide one view, while per-capita and country-level trends reveal additional differences in emission patterns.

The project also helped me practice the complete data analytics workflow — from data quality checks and exploratory analysis to visualization and communicating insights through a dashboard.

